# Plugins (`plugins/`, `registry/`)

Full context: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

## Layout

- Registry row in `registry/plugins.yaml` (id, path, version, summary)
- Plugin root: `.agentic/plugin.yaml` — `name` and `version` must match registry
- Skills: `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` with YAML frontmatter
- Agents: `agents/<name>.md` with YAML frontmatter
- Provider manifests: `plugin.json`, `.cursor-plugin/`, `.claude-plugin/`, `.codex-plugin/`

## Workflow

```bash
agent-foundry create-plugin <plugin_id>   # lowercase kebab-case
# edit bundle, then:
agent-foundry validate-plugins
```

Reference: `plugins/git/`. `remove-plugin` only mutates this repo, not user installs.

## Checklist

- [ ] Plugin id is lowercase kebab-case
- [ ] Manifest version matches `registry/plugins.yaml`
- [ ] `validate-plugins` passes before PR
